      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I AM WILMA (4) carried on her strong form from last campaign when she led from one spot wider than this and drew away to cruise home by 18m at this circuit and distance. Should only be better for that so looks tough to stop. SKYBELLA (3) was a beaten favourite last time but did come from wider. Led to score by 2.5m here prior so is better served by this barrier. PROHIBITED GRACE (5) draws wider but there was plenty of merit in her latest effort when beaten narrowly here. The latest from of ALDEBARAN SUE (10) doesn't leap off the page and she may need some luck from this draw but she showed what she is capable of when recording back-to-back Brisbane wins in July. LITTLE MISS VALLEY (8) was only 1.5m away when  resuming at Kilmore and is proven second-up so could progress.",
